<title>UK: Merrill prices $425 mln bond for Citibank CCMT.</title>
<headline>Merrill prices $425 mln bond for Citibank CCMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITIBANK CREDIT CARD MASTER TRUST 1997-3</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	COUPON     6.839     LEGAL MAT   10.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+50 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	EXPECTED MATURITY 10.FEB.02. CALLABLE FROM FEB.00</p>
<p>THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B NOTES OF $25.54 MLN, LEAD MANAGED BY CITIBANK, WITH AN  ISSUE/REOFFER PRICE OF PAR AND A COUPON OF 6.989 RATED A2/A -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
